OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy start to the
OL,6,Fday, but otherwise a mix of brighter
OL,7,Fspells and scattered showers for
OL,8,FFriday. Southwest winds fresh to
OL,9,Fstrong, easing a little late afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers isolated through the
OL,12,Fevening, before turning frequent and
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy overnight, bringing
OL,14,Fthe risk of hail and thunder as south
OL,15,Fto southwest winds increasing fresh to
OL,16,Fstrong.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FSharp showers at first, soon
OL,19,Fdwindling to leave a mainly dry day of
OL,20,Fsunny spells. Fresh southwest winds
OL,21,Fbacking to the south for the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
