OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry,
OL,6,Fbright start to Sunday, then winds
OL,7,Fstrengthening into afternoon as,
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy, rain develops.
OL,9,FScattered light showers and brighter
OL,10,Fspells Monday. Tuesday starting fair,
OL,11,Fthen gales, rain developing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
